  "title": [
    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "The path curves slightly westward here around a both ancient and very dead tree.  Its leafless limbs stretch up and out, over the path toward the sky, as if searching for something unknowable like a penitent at prayer.  Though dead, the tree is sturdy and hale, with black bark and crevices between the clusters of branches and within the trunk itself that invite investigation.  Beneath the tree's menacing guard are several crypts in a row, spaced out on either side of its looming countenance."
  ],
